                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f63df1d-bac5-4d9e-a16f-3507eaafa19d",
                                                "sense_id": "0f0fa268-c064-34eb-a2de-0585cb3bf2ea",
                                                "text": "The 10-inch increase forecast in the new study, which does not give a timeline, could be much higher if temperatures continue to rise, as they almost certainly will, said Jason Box, a glaciologist at the Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland who was the paper’s lead author."
                                            }
